
# 🎯 **Unity Cursor Cheat Sheet**

## ✔ Show cursor

```csharp
Cursor.visible = true;
```

## ✔ Hide cursor

```csharp
Cursor.visible = false;
```

---

# 🎯 **Cursor Lock States**

## ✔ Free cursor (normal)

* Cursor moves normally
* Visible
* Can click UI / objects
* No rotation lock

```csharp
Cursor.lockState = CursorLockMode.None;
```

---

## ✔ Locked cursor (FPS mode)

* Locked in center
* Invisible
* Unlimited rotation

```csharp
Cursor.lockState = CursorLockMode.Locked;
Cursor.visible = false;
```

---

## ✔ Confined cursor (kept inside game window)

* Visible
* Can move but cannot leave window
* Useful for RTS or editor mode

```csharp
Cursor.lockState = CursorLockMode.Confined;
Cursor.visible = true;
```

---

# 🎯 **Common Camera Modes**

## 🟦 Free-Look With Visible Cursor (your mode)

Rotate with RMB, but cursor stays visible & free.

```csharp
if (Input.GetMouseButton(1))
{
    Cursor.lockState = CursorLockMode.None;
    Cursor.visible = true;
}
```

---

## 🟥 FPS Mode (classic)

Hide cursor + lock to center when playing.

```csharp
Cursor.lockState = CursorLockMode.Locked;
Cursor.visible = false;
```

---

## 🟨 Toggle Lock on Press (press Esc to show cursor)

```csharp
if (Input.GetKeyDown(KeyCode.Escape))
{
    Cursor.lockState = CursorLockMode.None;
    Cursor.visible = true;
}

if (Input.GetMouseButtonDown(0))
{
    Cursor.lockState = CursorLockMode.Locked;
    Cursor.visible = false;
}
```

---

# 🎯 **Useful Patterns**

## ✔ Temporarily disable UI clicks while rotating

```csharp
bool IsRotating => Input.GetMouseButton(1);
```

---

## ✔ Only hide cursor while rotating

```csharp
if (Input.GetMouseButtonDown(1))
{
    Cursor.visible = false;
}
if (Input.GetMouseButtonUp(1))
{
    Cursor.visible = true;
}
```

---

## ✔ Center cursor manually (rare)

```csharp
Cursor.lockState = CursorLockMode.Locked;
Cursor.lockState = CursorLockMode.None; // releases but cursor remains centered
```

---

